TI  - Cybersecure Synchronisation of Entangled Quantum Neural Networks With Reconfigurable Intelligent Surface and Quantum Key Distribution for 6G Holographic Communications
AU  - Raad S. Alhumaima
AU  - Yassir AL-Karawi
AU  - Hamed Al-Raweshidy
PY  - 2026
